### ============================================
### Playground API Tests
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000
### ============================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@playgroundId =
@inviteCode =

### ============================================
### 1. List Playgrounds
### ============================================
# @name listPlaygrounds
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/playgrounds
Content-Type: application/json

###

### List Playgrounds with Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/playgrounds?take=10&skip=0
Content-Type: application/json

###

### List PUBLIC Playgrounds Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/playgrounds?visibility=PUBLIC
Content-Type: application/json

###

### List PRIVATE Playgrounds Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/playgrounds?visibility=PRIVATE
Content-Type: application/json

###

### ============================================
### 2. Create Playground
### ============================================
# @name createPlayground
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/playgrounds
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "晨跑团",
  "description": "每周三次晨跑，欢迎加入！",
  "visibility": "PUBLIC",
  "locationLat": 39.9042,
  "locationLng": 116.4074,
  "locationAddr": "北京市天安门广场"
}

###

### Create Private Playground
# @name createPrivatePlayground
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/playgrounds
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "公司跑步小组",
  "description": "公司内部跑步活动",
  "visibility": "PRIVATE"
}

###

### Create Minimal Playground (only name required)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/playgrounds
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "测试域"
}

###

### ============================================
### 3. Get Playground Details
### ============================================
# @name getPlayground
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/playgrounds/{{createPlayground.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get Playground by ID (manual)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/playgrounds/{{playgroundId}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### ============================================
### 4. Update Playground (Owner Only)
### ============================================
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/playgrounds/{{createPlayground.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "晨跑团 2.0",
  "description": "更新后的描述",
  "locationAddr": "北京市朝阳公园"
}

###

### Update Visibility
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/playgrounds/{{createPlayground.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "visibility": "PRIVATE"
}

###

### Update Location
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/playgrounds/{{createPlayground.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "locationLat": 39.9289,
  "locationLng": 116.3883,
  "locationAddr": "北京市西城区故宫博物院"
}

###

### ============================================
### 5. Get Members
### ============================================
# @name getMembers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/playgrounds/{{createPlayground.response.body.id}}/members
Content-Type: application/json

###

### ============================================
### 6. Generate Invite Code (Owner Only)
### ============================================
# @name generateInviteCode
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/playgrounds/{{createPlayground.response.body.id}}/invite-codes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "maxUses": 0,
  "expiresInHours": null
}

###

### Generate Invite Code with Limits
# @name generateLimitedInviteCode
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/playgrounds/{{createPlayground.response.body.id}}/invite-codes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "maxUses": 50,
  "expiresInHours": 168
}

###

### Generate Temporary Invite Code (24 hours)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/playgrounds/{{createPlayground.response.body.id}}/invite-codes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "maxUses": 10,
  "expiresInHours": 24
}

###

### ============================================
### 7. List Invite Codes (Owner Only)
### ============================================
# @name listInviteCodes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/playgrounds/{{createPlayground.response.body.id}}/invite-codes
Content-Type: application/json

###

### ============================================
### 8. Join Playground
### ============================================
# @name joinPlayground
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/playgrounds/{{createPlayground.response.body.id}}/join
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inviteCode": "{{generateInviteCode.response.body.code}}"
}

###

### Join with Manual Invite Code
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/playgrounds/{{playgroundId}}/join
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inviteCode": "{{inviteCode}}"
}

###

### ============================================
### 9. Leave Playground
### ============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/playgrounds/{{createPlayground.response.body.id}}/leave
Content-Type: application/json

###

### ============================================
### 10. Get Leaderboard
### ============================================
# @name getLeaderboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/playgrounds/{{createPlayground.response.body.id}}/leaderboard
Content-Type: application/json

###

### ============================================
### 11. Delete Playground (Owner Only)
### ============================================
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/playgrounds/{{createPlayground.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### ============================================
### Error Cases
### ============================================

### Create Playground without Name (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/playgrounds
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "没有名字"
}

###

### Get Non-existent Playground (should return 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/playgrounds/non-existent-id
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Join with Invalid Invite Code (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/playgrounds/{{createPlayground.response.body.id}}/join
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inviteCode": "INVALID"
}

###

### Update Playground as Non-Owner (should return 403)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/playgrounds/{{playgroundId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Unauthorized Update"
}

###

### Delete Playground as Non-Owner (should return 403)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/playgrounds/{{playgroundId}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### ============================================
### Complete Test Flow
### ============================================

### Step 1: Create a new playground
# @name flowCreatePlayground
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/playgrounds
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "完整测试流程",
  "description": "用于测试完整流程的域",
  "visibility": "PUBLIC",
  "locationAddr": "测试地点"
}

###

### Step 2: Generate invite code
# @name flowGenerateCode
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/playgrounds/{{flowCreatePlayground.response.body.id}}/invite-codes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "maxUses": 5,
  "expiresInHours": 72
}

###

### Step 3: Get playground details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/playgrounds/{{flowCreatePlayground.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Step 4: List all invite codes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/playgrounds/{{flowCreatePlayground.response.body.id}}/invite-codes
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Step 5: Get members list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/playgrounds/{{flowCreatePlayground.response.body.id}}/members
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Step 6: Update playground info
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/playgrounds/{{flowCreatePlayground.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "完整测试流程 (已更新)",
  "description": "描述已更新"
}

###

### Step 7: Get leaderboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/playgrounds/{{flowCreatePlayground.response.body.id}}/leaderboard
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Step 8: Clean up - Delete playground
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/playgrounds/{{flowCreatePlayground.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

###
